== room | NIGHT BEFORE · ADE'S ROOM | bedroom at night with an open suitcase, clothes everywhere and a passport on the bed | phone
ade (cheer): Quddus! My suitcase is ready. Passport, admission letter, all my documents, at the very bottom, under my jollof spices.
quddus (shock): Ade! Take them out. Important documents go in your hand luggage, with you.
ade (worried): Why?
quddus (talk): Big suitcases can get delayed or lost. And at immigration, they may ask for documents before you even get your bag.

== airport | NEXT MORNING · AIRPORT | busy international airport check-in hall with departure boards and trolleys | stand
quddus (point): Keep this in your hand luggage, in one folder.
> 1f4cb | HAND LUGGAGE FOLDER | 1f4cb Passport + visa | 1f4e9 Admission letter | 1f4b0 Proof of funds / scholarship letter | 1f3e0 Your address + school contact
ade (think): What if I lose the folder?
quddus (talk): Save scanned copies on your phone and in your email. And share your flight details with family.
ade (worried): And the jollof spices?
quddus (thumbs): Check the customs rules of your new country first. Some foods are not allowed.
ade (cheer): Documents in my hand, spices checked, and Ade is ready to fly!
